 Sanogo also had nine rebounds, while Bouknight posted six rebounds.\n\n\r\n                    <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/mens-college-basketball/player/_/id/4279789/rj-cole\">R.J. Cole</a> had 14 points for UConn (13-6, 10-6 Big East Conference).\n\n\r\n                    <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/mens-college-basketball/player/_/id/4278580/sandro-mamukelashvili\">Sandro Mamukelashvili</a> had 20 points and 10 rebounds for the Pirates (13-11, 10-8). <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/mens-college-basketball/player/_/id/4397119/jared-rhoden\">Jared Rhoden</a> added 16 points. <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/mens-college-basketball/player/_/id/4277851/ike-obiagu\">Ike Obiagu</a> had three blocks.\n\n\r\n                    The Huskies leveled the season series against the Pirates. Seton Hall defeated UConn 80-73 on Feb. 6.\n\n\r\n                    ------\n\n\r\n                    For more AP college basketball coverage: https://apnews.com/Collegebasketball and http://twitter.com/AP--Top25\n\n\r\n                    ------\n\n\r\n                    This was generated by Automated Insights, http://www.automatedinsights.com/ap, using data from STATS LLC, https://www.stats.com","images":[]},"videos":[],"news":[],"source":{"summary":true,"boxscore":"full","playByPlay":"full"}}